sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant H as Help desk
    participant A as LLM agent<br/>(router + ReAct)
    participant S as Scratchpad
    participant T as supportkit tools
    participant E as Evaluator
    participant P as Human desk<br/>(support agent / manager)
    participant X as Legal / Security team

    C->>H: Submit ticket
    H->>A: Ticket + verified sender email
    Note over A: [GUARD] injection scan — ticket text is data, never instructions
    A->>S: write intake + flags
    A->>T: lookup_customer(sender_email)
    Note over A,T: [SCOPE] read · auto  [RETRY] 1-2-4 s  [BREAKER] 5 fails
    T-->>A: customer (masked: no card no., no password)
    A->>A: classify_ticket() → class + confidence
    A->>S: decision = branch
    Note over A,S: [BRANCH] auto_close | route_to_human | escalate | unknown

    alt auto_close (order_status / how_to AND conf ≥ 0.85)
        A->>T: lookup_order / search_kb
        T-->>A: order status / KB article
        A->>A: draft from safe template
    else route_to_human — refund
        A->>T: lookup_order(order_id)
        T-->>A: order (amount comes from the record)
        opt order not the sender's
            A->>T: escalate_case(fraud_review)
            Note over A: no refund · no order details revealed
        end
        A->>S: refund_amount + idempotency_key (BEFORE money)
        alt amount ≤ NZ$100
            A->>P: approve refund? (support agent)
        else amount > NZ$100
            A->>P: approve refund? (manager)
        end
        Note over A,P: [HITL GATE] money  [TIME LANE] 15 min
        alt approved
            P-->>A: approved (bound to order + amount)
            A->>T: issue_refund(order, amount, idempotency_key)
            T-->>A: refund_id
            A->>S: refund_id
        else rejected
            P-->>A: rejected + reason
            A->>A: draft alternative (inspection / repair)
        else no answer in 15 min
            A->>T: escalate_case(refunds)
            Note over A: [SAFE DEFAULT] never refund on a timeout → holding reply
        end
    else route_to_human — account change
        Note over A,T: change_email / close_account / update_payment NOT EXPOSED
        A->>T: escalate_case(accounts)
    else escalate — legal threat or injection
        A->>A: counter-model risk score
        A->>T: escalate_case(legal | security)
        A->>X: two-factor review
        Note over A,X: [TWO-FACTOR] counter-model + person
        X-->>A: decision
    else unknown (conf < 0.5)
        A->>T: escalate_case(general)
        A->>A: draft clarifying question
        Note over A: [STOPS] max 3 questions
    end

    A->>E: draft reply
    E-->>A: pass / revise (Reflexion)
    Note over A,E: checks: no false refund claim · no other customer data · no card no. · no liability
    A->>P: approve reply? (every reply)
    Note over A,P: [HITL GATE] every outbound message
    P-->>A: approved / rejected
    A->>T: send_reply (only with approval) · update_ticket
    A->>S: final status + log · episodic memory
    Note over A,S: [STOPS] 12 steps — if hit, or breaker open: pending_human, nothing sent
    H->>C: Reply
